# Deploy to Localhost After Each Iteration

After making changes to this project:

1. Run `npm run refresh` — this kills all Next.js processes, builds, and starts the server at **http://localhost:3333**
2. Or run `npm run kill` first to clear dev servers, then `npm run build` and `npx next start -p 3333`

Do this after every iteration so the user can review changes immediately.
